  "description": "What can you say about Matt Hadan - The Diesel!! A true BMX Icon, and all around good egg! You know when it came time to introduce the Aluminum Era, there were a few people in mind to help with the introduction, but the Diesel stepped right up and claimed the title, with the Oversize Down tube and Dual Top Tubes, the Diesel is rollin' coal, all the way to the finish line. And of course it comes stock with a Cro-mo Torker Heat Treated Race Fork to match.\nModern Race Geometry:\n20\" PRO XL - TPXLD001 - TPXLD025 etc...\n20\" PRO XXL - TXXLD2X001 - TXXLD2X025 etc...\n24\" - TMHD4001 - TMHD4025\n26\" - TMHD6001 - TMHD6025\n29\" - TMHD9001 - TMHD9025\nPlease make sure you read the full description. We want your buying and riding experience to be the best it can be. Note there is now a Frame only Variant for the Black 20\" Pro XXL\nTraditional dual top tube race frame\nRetro Styled Integrated Campy® Headtube\n3/8\" (10mm) Dropouts\n31.9 clamp ( 1 1/4\" ) Sometimes called 31.8 clamp as well",
